    {
      "mechanism_id": "curvature_power_law",
      "statement": "The probability distribution of dimensionless eigenphase curvatures k follows a power-law decay for large k, with exponent beta_tilde = 2 for Poisson (integrable) dynamics and beta_tilde = 4 for GUE (chaotic) dynamics.",
