              "line_end": 330,
              "support": "For large k, Eq. (Curv) gives a power-law behavior, P(k->infinity) proportional to |k|^(-beta_tilde) with beta_tilde=2(4) for the Poisson (GUE) case."
            },
            {
              "line_start": 360,
              "line_end": 360,
              "support": "reproducing the GUE exponent of beta_tilde=4 for all but the initial time interval."
